# Collected data. The corpus is regenerated by running the collector, and is
# far too large to version. What IS committed: the collection code, the frozen
# reference snapshots, the contract specs, and the deterministic fixtures --
# everything needed to reproduce a result except the raw crawl itself.
data/raw/
data/normalized/
data/derived/
!data/fixtures/
!data/reference/

# Secrets. The API key is IP-bound but still a credential.
.env
*.key

# C++ build output (Phase 4)
cpp/build/
*.pyd
*.so

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
